  "translation": "Wathi inkosi: “Ingaba isandla sikaYowabhi ⟨את⟩ sinawwe kwazo zonke ezi?” Yaphendula umfazi wathi: “Njengokuphila kwomphefumlo wakho, nkosi yam inkosi, akukho mntu unokujika ekunene okanye ekhohlo kwanto eyayithethwa yinkosi yam inkosi; kuba inkonzi yakho uYowabhi, yena undalele, yena wabiza emlonyeni wencedishi yakho ⟨את⟩ la mazwi onke.”",
